<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0060EB;
      color: white;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0060EB;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Your Request Status Has Been Updated To {{status}}</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>
      You submitted a request for blood donation:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Blood Group:</strong> {{request.bloodGroup}}</li>
      <li><strong>Quantity:</strong> {{request.quantity}}</li>
      <li><strong>Price Per Pint:</strong> {{request.pricePerPint}}</li>
      <li><strong>Facility:</strong> {{request.facility.organizationName}}</li>
      <li><strong>Submission Date:</strong> {{createdAt}}</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Your request status has been updated to <strong>{{status}}</strong>. Please log in to your account to view the details of your request.
    </p>

    <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please <a style="text-decoration: underline;" href="mailto:support@bloodbridge.com">contact the BloodBridge support team</a>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <b>BloodBridge Administration</b>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
